      <span class="relief-principles__kicker">
        Chapter two
      </span>

      <h2 class="relief-principles__heading">
        Four principles, and none of <br>
them is "buy more".
      </h2>

      <ol class="relief-principles__list"><li class="relief-principles__item" style="--rp-delay: 0ms;">
            <b class="relief-principles__number"><img src="/assets/media/download_1-83006355b4.webp" alt="Principle image" srcset="/assets/media/download_1-83006355b4.webp 80w, /assets/media/download_1-83006355b4.webp 120w, /assets/media/download_1-83006355b4.webp 180w" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy" sizes="78px" class="relief-principles__image">
<em>01</em>
            </b>

            <strong>Focus</strong>

            <span><p>Fewer, higher-value interventions. One serum with a clear role in the routine, instead of five with overlapping ones and no idea which is working.</p></span>
          </li><li class="relief-principles__item" style="--rp-delay: 110ms;">
            <b class="relief-principles__number"><img src="/assets/media/download_2-5d02b59bb6.webp" alt="Principle image" srcset="/assets/media/download_2-5d02b59bb6.webp 80w, /assets/media/download_2-5d02b59bb6.webp 120w, /assets/media/download_2-5d02b59bb6.webp 180w" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy" sizes="78px" class="relief-principles__image">
<em>02</em>
            </b>

            <strong>Consistency</strong>

            <span><p>A routine only works when it is simple enough to keep. The goal is fewer decisions, not more products.</p></span>
          </li><li class="relief-principles__item" style="--rp-delay: 220ms;">
            <b class="relief-principles__number"><img src="/assets/media/download_3-72cb3a75d2.webp" alt="Principle image" srcset="/assets/media/download_3-72cb3a75d2.webp 80w, /assets/media/download_3-72cb3a75d2.webp 120w, /assets/media/download_3-72cb3a75d2.webp 180w" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy" sizes="78px" class="relief-principles__image">
<em>03</em>
            </b>

            <strong>Coverage</strong>

            <span><p>Choose interventions that support several dimensions of skin quality at once, rather than collecting overlapping single-purpose steps.</p></span>
          </li><li class="relief-principles__item" style="--rp-delay: 330ms;">
            <b class="relief-principles__number"><img src="/assets/media/download_4-3c5f724783.webp" alt="Principle image" srcset="/assets/media/download_4-3c5f724783.webp 80w, /assets/media/download_4-3c5f724783.webp 120w, /assets/media/download_4-3c5f724783.webp 180w" width="180" height="180" loading="lazy" sizes="78px" class="relief-principles__image">
<em>04</em>
            </b>

            <strong>Restraint</strong>

            <span><p>Add something because it has a clear job, not because another product has convinced you that your routine is incomplete.</p></span>
          </li></ol>
